    <h1>Desktop apps for running coding agents, compared</h1>
    <p class="article-standfirst">
      We make one of these, so treat the opinions accordingly. Not the facts.
      Every claim below about someone else is quoted from their own public page and
      dated, and each product has a straight answer for when it is the better pick.
    </p>
